'Documento': 'Document',
'Dos personas, un mismo Spectrum: tú y otro jugador jugáis a la vez, cada uno con su\n            teclado, como si estuvierais sentados ante la misma máquina. Solo con juegos pensados para dos\n            jugadores a la vez (Way of the Exploding Fist, International Karate, Match Day II…). Carga el\n            juego, crea la partida y pásale el código; tu partida entera viaja a su navegador.': 'Two people, one Spectrum: you and another player play at the same time, each on your own keyboard, as if you were sitting in front of the same machine. Only with games designed for two simultaneous players (Way of the Exploding Fist, International Karate, Match Day II…). Load the game, create the game and tell them the code; your whole game travels to their browser.',
