'LOAD *"m";1;"{0}" tecleado: el cartucho no trae «run» y ese es su único programa. No arranca solo: cuando acabe de cargar, escribe RUN.': 'LOAD *"m";1;"{0}" typed: the cartridge has no “run” and that is its only program. It does not start by itself: when it finishes loading, type RUN.',
